Your budget: 30 rounds and 64 calls per leg, up to 4 leg(s), 1200 s wall per leg. Reads first; before your first call that changes anything, `work update steps=` on your session with the count the traced plan implies. At a checkpoint, `work update next_move=` with the exact resume point — a leg that ends at its budget continues from it; a leg that ends without one starts by asking for it.

